  "description": "The 735 represents the pinnacle of fixed-gear bikes, equipped with only the most essential functions for cycling.\n\nThe robust silhouette of its frame, which turns heads, is crafted from custom pipes that are meticulously filled and polished by hand to balance strength and lightness. This gives the bike an otherworldly, floating ride quality that instantly pulls you out of the everyday.\n\nTo optimize the track racer for street use, LEADER has completely redesigned the geometry. With a steep 75.5° seat angle, a wide top tube, and a low standover height, the 735 offers quick response, stability, and the stop-and-go comfort derived from true track bikes.\n\nThe hallmark of the 735TR is its extra-thick frame, custom-made from aluminum 6061, chosen for its suitability for bicycles. The hydroforming process allows for complex tube shapes, and additional heat treatment ensures strength without sacrificing weight. This results in a frame that is both thick and lightweight, characteristic of LEADER's distinctive silhouette.\n\nThe beautifully welded joints, often mistaken for monocoque construction, are achieved through a special smooth welding process. The weld marks are polished and filled by hand, achieving both lightness and high strength. This meticulous craftsmanship is a testament to LEADER's dedication to producing high-quality fixed-gear bikes.\n\nAddressing the common \"brake issue\" in fixed-gear bikes, all LEADER models come with standard brakes. The 735 features an internal brake cable routing system, maintaining the bike's sleek design without compromising functionality.\n\nThe difference between a bike made from off-the-shelf pipes and a truly original creation lies in the attention to detail and investment in craftsmanship.",
